      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just launched its Fall/Winter 2026 collection on the official website, with pieces inspired by the landscapes of the founder's native Jura Mountains in France. The designer blends natural elements—mountain chalets, bird nests, animal motifs, and wood textures—with sculptural silhouettes, evoking a pastoral, poetic atmosphere.",
