    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Bird House hard-sided case takes its cue from an outdoor wooden birdhouse, crafted with a wood structure and wrapped in leather and Monogram canvas for the roof and handles, complete with metal corners and an S-lock clasp. It can be used as a suitcase or storage box, conjuring images of a fairytale cabin and brimming with rustic charm.",
