      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Birdie handbag uses Monogram canvas to shape a plump, rounded bird's nest silhouette, paired with VVN leather handles and a tent-shaped flap. Its compact form can be carried by hand or tucked under the arm, while the trunk-style clasp adds a refined touch.",
