    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bundle Trunk handbag draws inspiration from Louis Vuitton's legendary journey from the Jura Mountains to Paris. Crafted in smooth calfskin with a soft structure, the monochrome tone highlights trompe-l'oeil trunk corners, while the LV Blason emblem and metal hardware on the sides add subtle detailing. Available in black and grass green, the top knot allows the strap length to be adjusted for various carrying styles; on the runway, the model slung it over a shepherd's crook, evoking a fairytale sorceress with her wand.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
